     3681   PROCEDURE proc-br-bank :
     3682   define variable vss-include-info30 as character format "x(65)" no-undo initial "@(#)$Workfile$ $Revision$".
     3683   if b-sel:sensitive in frame Dialog-Frame then dO:
     3684       if b-mark:sensitive then do:
